  "Attributes": [
    {
      "Id": 759162,
      "attributeType": "LongString",
      "attributeName": "AIDescription",
      "attributeRelationType": "None",
      "Value": "## 100% Pascal Sensei - Kanpeki Paint Bombers for Nintendo 3DS\n\nDive into the chaotic and hilarious world of *100% Pascal Sensei* with *Kanpeki Paint Bombers* for Nintendo 3DS! This action-packed game brings the lovable, unbelievably clueless Pascal Sensei to life as you and your friends battle against the mischievous \"Dark Students\" who are trying to drain the color and joy from his classroom.\n\nAs Pascal, you’ll wield powerful paint bombs, launching them at enemies in frantic, three-on-three battles. Utilize a variety of bomb types, each with unique effects, to overcome challenging obstacles and defeat quirky bosses.  The game features a vibrant, cartoonish art style that perfectly captures the manga’s humor. \n\nTeam up with other Pascal Sensei characters, each possessing their own special abilities, to strategize and conquer the Dark Students’ schemes.  Enjoy a story mode following Pascal’s misadventures, alongside a robust multiplayer mode for even more colorful chaos with friends. Get ready for a truly absurd and unforgettable 3DS experience!"
    },
